{"title":"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> denote the value of the sum\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/2/04232c9e753b7168ec35810125ebb17786ddf7de.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{n = 1}^{9800} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n + \\sqrt{n^2 - 1}}}\\]\" width=\"147\" height=\"50\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> can be expressed as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/3/6330e31541d3251beca51821e5d0383569ed5075.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p + q \\sqrt{r}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/c/0ec2b6f850a38c18bff9b2d860b248982102966e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p, q,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"31\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> are positive integers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is not divisible by the square of any prime. Determine <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/d/70d212c459fbffb5d5822c41ea9d670acfe19b26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p + q + r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/6/c36e97f4b9e918092dc66f08e1aae211f26a5bd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{n + \\sqrt{n^2 - 1}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\sqrt{2n + 2\\sqrt{(n+1)(n-1)}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(\\sqrt{n+1}+\\sqrt{n-1}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"578\" height=\"47\" />. Thus, we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/2/04232c9e753b7168ec35810125ebb17786ddf7de.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{n = 1}^{9800} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n + \\sqrt{n^2 - 1}}}\\]\" width=\"147\" height=\"50\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/9/f496ffe5cd7a9cc8dbe2f46f04cce9fe131301cb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\sqrt{2}\\sum_{n = 1}^{9800} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n+1}+\\sqrt{n-1}}\\]\" width=\"214\" height=\"50\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/c/b4c362df83e615c24ee647f57ba1180a897ea49c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\sum_{n = 1}^{9800} \\left(\\sqrt{n+1}-\\sqrt{n-1}\\right)\\]\" width=\"234\" height=\"50\" />\n</p><p>This is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Telescoping_series\" title=\"Telescoping series\">telescoping series</a>; note that when we expand the summation, all of the intermediary terms cancel, leaving us with \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/2/ee2eb2aa020eaa5b797a77dd056d713bf906e3cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(\\sqrt{9801}+\\sqrt{9800}-\\sqrt{1}-\\sqrt{0}\\right) = 70 + 49\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"378\" height=\"41\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/2/db2ea56647bbe61ad67dc1e121d776f5d46bc43b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q+r=\\boxed{121}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"135\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Simplifying the expression yields\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/e/93eb263fae31732cfb1b4b7a6a90cc17bca6d53d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} S &amp;= \\sum_{n=1}^{9800}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n+\\sqrt{n^2-1}}} \\\\ &amp;= \\sum_{n=1}^{9800}\\frac{\\sqrt{n+\\sqrt{n^2-1}}}{n+\\sqrt{n^2-1}} \\\\ &amp;= \\sum_{n=1}^{9800}(\\frac{\\sqrt{n+\\sqrt{n^2-1}}}{n+\\sqrt{n^2-1}})\\cdot(\\frac{n-\\sqrt{n^2-1}}{n-\\sqrt{n^2-1}}) \\\\ &amp;= \\sum_{n=1}^{9800}(\\sqrt{n+\\sqrt{n^2-1}})\\cdot(\\sqrt{n+\\sqrt{n^2-1}})^2 \\\\ &amp;= \\sum_{n=1}^{9800}\\sqrt{n-\\sqrt{n^2-1}} \\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"341\" height=\"291\" />\nNow we can assume that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/1/3a10528600f3773922b4f07fd70bf4f7ffa98b82.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{n+\\sqrt{n^2-1}}=a+b\\sqrt{c}\\]\" width=\"201\" height=\"32\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/3/3a39c0e39ebdbb89c8a43d7ff6512f3dd5971fe8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{n-\\sqrt{n^2-1}}=a-b\\sqrt{c}\\]\" width=\"201\" height=\"32\" />\nfor some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. \n</p><p>Squaring the first equation yields \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/6/1a6875f0856bcd76df720a6c0ee89d03bf6b7a12.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n+\\sqrt{n^2-1}=a^2+b^2c+2ab\\sqrt{c}\\]\" width=\"255\" height=\"20\" />\nwhich gives the system of equations\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/0/76065cc6605d054b3d5f1aafc02eb87e091bc24f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n=a^2+b^2c\\]\" width=\"97\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/0/ae0b50c9638003715f28cd297158541d3ad2a762.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{n^2-1}=2ab\\sqrt{c}\\]\" width=\"138\" height=\"20\" />\ncalling them equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, respectively. \n</p><p>Also we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/6/f16e8d89211a3d57ce30ea344878cc1a55373d2c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n+\\sqrt{n^2-1}}}=\\sqrt{n-\\sqrt{n^2-1}}\\]\" width=\"258\" height=\"46\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/5/e25f87d464d4722631d1cecf59f9dc6610bab56f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{a+b\\sqrt{c}}=a-b\\sqrt{c}\\]\" width=\"152\" height=\"41\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/8/5b8a1b1485b36edb0aecb46d6604414ab2297585.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2-b^2c=1\\]\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />\nwhich obtains equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Adding equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> yields \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/4/c447d237597c83e0d237037b53e93dcb8dc64864.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2a^2=n+1\\]\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/7/05799c864b4b03a61d2dc8b6ee8de5c8654cbad6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a=\\sqrt{\\frac{n+1}{2}}\\]\" width=\"97\" height=\"43\" />\nSquaring equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and substituting yields\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/5/30537979bea32c723c34295e236aea438e5a37da.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4a^2b^2c=n^2-1\\]\" width=\"121\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/e/6ae7b29682c783270a0cf86409b1a81794521b4e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2\\cdot(n+1)\\cdot b^2c=n^2-1\\]\" width=\"187\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/2/8a2d1395c896f360d5fae7a74d127f2f4a73a730.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b^2c=\\frac{(n-1)(n+1)}{2\\cdot(n+1)}\\]\" width=\"162\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0055cf8f5235b53601f0cbc5d3d83ebd7e3ba4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b\\sqrt{c}=\\sqrt{\\frac{n-1}{2}}\\]\" width=\"118\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Thus we obtain the telescoping series\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/5/d957be0934d96953d82ba6346629bbe4c3598ebb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} S &amp;= \\sum_{n=1}^{9800}a-b\\sqrt{c} \\\\ &amp;= \\sum_{n=1}^{9800}\\sqrt{\\frac{n+1}{2}}-\\sqrt{\\frac{n-1}{2}} \\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"216\" height=\"110\" />\n</p><p>Simplifying the sum we are left with\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/d/72dfdcf7ceabb205513adc0d9026f10ab3639cc9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} S &amp;= -\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{2}}+\\sqrt{\\frac{9800}{2}}+\\sqrt{\\frac{9801}{2}} \\\\ &amp;= -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}+\\frac{99\\sqrt{2}}{2}+70 \\\\ &amp;= 70+49\\sqrt{2} \\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"241\" height=\"116\" />\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/e/2ee925cc0f1a254f52feeb340f267ac17534657b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q+r=70+49+2=\\boxed{121}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"249\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n~ Nafer\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005\">Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=19349\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018001821\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 279/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1422/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 180/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8206/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   